# Tauri / Rust

- Commands in `src-tauri/src/commands/`; HTTP in `src-tauri/src/hostinger/`.
- Use `#[tauri::command]`; return `Result<T, String>` with `HostingerError` mapped to JSON.
- Store API keys with `keyring` crate only — never `tauri-plugin-store`.
- Use `reqwest` with rustls for Hostinger HTTPS.
- Stub unimplemented commands with `HostingerError::NotImplemented` until spec ships.
- Run `cargo fmt` and `cargo clippy` before PR.

```rust
// ✅ GOOD
#[tauri::command]
pub async fn list_projects(vm_id: u64) -> Result<Vec<DockerProjectSummary>, String> {
    let api_key = load_api_key().map_err(String::from)?;
    // ...
}
```
